  "solution": "Given:\n\n 72 ÷ 180 × 5 - [96 of 64 × 5 - 25 ÷ 16 × (23 - 29) - 11] ÷ 75 over 6 \n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/bf30f37945dd983713c79f4e75972597226df7b829d8603182b9eed448249aba.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n⇒ 72 ÷ 180 × 5 + [96 ÷ 64 × 5 - 25 ÷ 16 × (23 - 29) - 11] ÷ 75 over 6\n\n⇒ 72/180 × 5 + [96/64 × 5 - 25 ÷ 16 × (23 - 29) - 11] ÷ 75 over 6\n\n⇒ 2 + [3/2 × 5 - 25/16 × (-6) - 11] ÷ 47/6\n\n⇒ 2 + [15/2 - (25/8 × -3) - 11] ÷ 47/6 \n\n⇒ 2 + (15/2 + 75/8 - 11) ÷ 47/6\n\n⇒ 2 + (60 + 75 - 88)/8 ÷ 47/6\n\n⇒ 2 + 47/8 ÷ 47/6\n\n⇒ 2 + 47/8 × 6/47\n\n⇒ 2 + 3/4\n\n⇒ ** 2 {3 over4}**",
